{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"schema_version\":\"route-familiarity-reference-collection-responses-v1\",\"status\":\"REFERENCE_COLLECTION_COMPLETE\",\"parent_queue_sha256\":\"620b736996ac254c43b3c721cdbfca20f7e68d8f553b7fe21b9effa0c025b3d2\",\"shard_id\":\"SHARD-04\",\"shard_file_sha256\":\"8e7c060fb15e6978c6614294de25a9a4a8dfe7e8000e0b0cc2046f63e52fca78\",\"item_count\":29,\"item_ids\":[\"RFR-0093\",\"RFR-0094\",\"RFR-0095\",\"RFR-0096\",\"RFR-0097\",\"RFR-0098\",\"RFR-0099\",\"RFR-0100\",\"RFR-0101\",\"RFR-0102\",\"RFR-0103\",\"RFR-0104\",\"RFR-0105\",\"RFR-0106\",\"RFR-0107\",\"RFR-0108\",\"RFR-0109\",\"RFR-0110\",\"RFR-0111\",\"RFR-0112\",\"RFR-0114\",\"RFR-0115\",\"RFR-0116\",\"RFR-0117\",\"RFR-0118\",\"RFR-0119\",\"RFR-0120\",\"RFR-0121\",\"RFR-0122\"],\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0093\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"“心智” correctly conveys “mind,” with no soul-related mistranslation.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0094\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"SURFACE_VISIBLE_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"The source says the power will lead “me,” but the target changes this to “我们” (“us”).\",\"defect_atoms\":[{\"kind\":\"ACCURACY\",\"claim\":\"The target changes the beneficiary from the singular speaker to a plural group.\",\"evidence\":\"Source: “lead me”; target: “带领我们” (“lead us”).\"}],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0095\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"“不能继续拖延征服大业” accurately conveys being unable to keep delaying the conquest.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0096\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target correctly locates the cracks on Mal'Rok and the other affected planets.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0097\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves both the lack of a charge from the speaker and the claim that the investment will recoup itself.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0098\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"“丢失几封信” accurately preserves the small quantity expressed by “a few letters.”\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0099\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves one rotting human hand, its black leather glove, and its severance at the wrist.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0100\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target conveys the commission of many atrocities and extensive destruction without adding revenge.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0101\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"SURFACE_VISIBLE_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"The source distinguishes “their” strongholds from what “you” call the Scourge, but the target renders both referents as “你们.”\",\"defect_atoms\":[{\"kind\":\"ACCURACY\",\"claim\":\"The target changes the owners of the strongholds from third person to the addressees.\",\"evidence\":\"Source: “All their strongholds” and later “you name”; target: “你们……所有的据点” and later “你们称作.”\"}],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0102\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the aggressive giants, their advanced steam technology, and their residence on the peninsula without inventing a separate quality.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0103\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the tunnel into Kruk, the giants pouring out, the absent bulk of Kruk's forces, and the intended destruction of the Pride.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0104\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"“阻止他们” correctly conveys stopping the attackers, and the consequence of Kruk's fall is preserved.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0105\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"SURFACE_VISIBLE_DEFECT\",\"evidence\":\"The target translates the lack of true sentience but entirely omits the description of the subjects as highly evolved bipedal animals.\",\"defect_atoms\":[{\"kind\":\"OMISSION\",\"claim\":\"The target omits a substantive description of the subjects.\",\"evidence\":\"Source includes “highly evolved bipedal animals”; the target contains only “他们仍然缺乏真正的意识.”\"}],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0106\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"“意识” conveys the transferred mind rather than changing it into a soul, and the purpose of increasing fighting power is preserved.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0107\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the proposition that psionics without a living mind had been considered impossible.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0108\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the plural machines, their extreme age, and their advanced psionic and technological power source.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0109\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target correctly makes the steam generators the entities strengthened by the psionic gestalt.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0110\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the assertion that reckless magic gravely threatens essentially everything and that this should be self-evident.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0111\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves all placeholders and accurately states the talent-failure and healing penalties plus the first qualifying weapon-type hit's acid damage each turn.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0112\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves both placeholders and accurately limits bursting flechettes to hostile melee or ranged attacks that hit the affected target.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0114\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the resistance placeholder and accurately describes two independent steamgun target selections, including possible convergence on one foe and the disarm effect.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0115\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"All placeholders and normal gestation damage are preserved; the additional description of reduced-strength premature hatching and larva generation matches the supplied runtime behavior.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0116\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the multiplier placeholder and accurately describes its immediate value, first successful same-target melee increment each turn, and termination on hitting another target.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0117\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the damage placeholder and accurately specifies the range-limited occult beam, termination conditions, innate-talent exclusion, and technomancy-first cooldown reduction.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0118\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the chance placeholder and accurately states the on-damage trigger, three-turn freeze, and 50% reduction in iceblock absorption.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0119\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the damage placeholder and accurately describes link termination, absence of damage on the terminating turn, half-damage healing, and further same-turn healing reductions.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0120\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"Both placeholders are preserved, and the target accurately identifies the stored quantity as blocked damage that accumulates up to a cap for a lightning discharge.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0121\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"The target preserves the placeholder and correctly excludes Strength, matching the supplied runtime behavior despite the source's broader wording.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}},{\"neutral_id\":\"RFR-0122\",\"response\":{\"label\":\"CLEAN\",\"evidence\":\"All three placeholders are preserved, and the target accurately restricts the fire retaliation to attackers whose melee attacks hit.\",\"defect_atoms\":[],\"source_evidence_sha256s\":[],\"limitations\":\"\"}}]}"}}
